{"version":1,"content":"<p>據可靠消息向本報透露，前中共中央政治局委員、國務院副總理劉延東今天在北京病逝，享年81歲。</p><p>劉延東與香港淵源深厚，曾任中央港澳協調小組副組長，曾經兩次訪問香港。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T10:21:36.824428+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":80,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T09:34:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T05:58:10.771773+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T10:18:13.903380+00:00","content_hash":"d8ab7046d593b21da07a4f4ab248adcf687dc441725c1f45c9118279b9e292d5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}